<title>MEXICO: Mexico's April average crude oil prices by type.</title>
<headline>Mexico's April average crude oil prices by type.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) updated average crude oil prices for April on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Below follows a comparative table of prices, by type and region exported.</p>
<p>    Type		  April 97     March 97    April 96</p>
<p>America</p>
<p>    Maya		    14.45	  14.85	 17.69</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 16.73	  18.46	 21.79</p>
<p>    Olmeca		  18.35	  19.75	 21.98</p>
<p>Europe</p>
<p>    Maya		    12.83	  13.16	 16.00</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 15.45	  16.90	 18.82</p>
<p>Far East</p>
<p>    Maya			n/a	  15.23	   n/a</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 17.74	  19.13	 17.71</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
